{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106624","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106624/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106624/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106624/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106624","id":3075998262,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6W1pDn","number":106624,"title":"Fix error when closing all scene tabs on the last tab","user":{"login":"timothyqiu","id":372476,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjQ3Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/372476?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu","html_url":"https://github.com/timothyqiu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-05-20T07:34:16Z","updated_at":"2025-06-03T00:33:45Z","closed_at":"2025-06-02T23:59:29Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106624","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106624","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106624.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106624.patch","merged_at":"2025-06-02T23:59:29Z"},"body":"To reproduce the error, open two scenes and right click on the last scene tab, choose \"Close All Tabs\".\r\n\r\nThe scenes will close successfully, but an error will be printed:\r\n\r\n```\r\nERROR: Index p_idx = 1 is out of bounds (edited_scene.size() = 1).\r\n   at: get_scene_path (editor/editor_data.cpp:893)\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis is because this context menu has two `id_pressed` handlers, one forwarding to `EditorNode`'s scene menu, the other is for custom menu items added by plugins:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/be3ecaeb3c51433058ad4e96ec892d18f4291efd/editor/gui/editor_scene_tabs.cpp#L434-L435\r\n\r\nThe error is caused by the menu item IDs in this context menu starting from 3000.\r\n\r\n- A very large number was picked so they don't clash with `EditorNode`'s scene menu item IDs.\r\n- However, IDs starting from 2000 are considered custom menu items added by plugins.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/be3ecaeb3c51433058ad4e96ec892d18f4291efd/editor/gui/editor_scene_tabs.h#L49-L55\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/be3ecaeb3c51433058ad4e96ec892d18f4291efd/editor/plugins/editor_context_menu_plugin.h#L58\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/be3ecaeb3c51433058ad4e96ec892d18f4291efd/editor/gui/editor_scene_tabs.cpp#L223-L227\r\n\r\nIn addition to being mistakened as a custom menu item, if the built-in menu item causes the current tab to be closed before the second handler `EditorSceneTabs::_custom_menu_option` is called, this error will occur.\r\n\r\nThis PR changes the starting item ID to 1000 so only one of the two handlers will be called.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106624/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106624/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}